'''All That Pikachu!''' is a graphic novel published by [[VIZ Media]] in North America. It is a manga-style book (branded as "Ani-Manga" by VIZ) which retells the stories of ''[[PK01|Pikachu's Vacation]]'' and ''[[PK04|Pikachu's Rescue Adventure]]'' using screenshots from both films. Both stories were previously released in the {{OBP|Pokémon the First Movie|graphic novel}} and {{OBP|Pokémon the Movie 2000|graphic novel}} graphic novels, which were out of print at the time of this book's publication. [[Hideki Sonoda]] and [[Takeshi Shudō]] are credited as the authors.

