==Synopsis==
The contents of this book are adapted from the [[Pikachu short]]s ''[[PK01|Pikachu's Vacation]]'' and ''[[PK04|Pikachu's Rescue Adventure]]''. At the end of each chapter are "[[Pokédex]]" sections with data about the main characters appearing in each story.

